bind Donor Identify: ID Donor
bind Contact Initiate: ID Donor, Method Contact
bind Meeting Conduct: ID Donor, Duration Meeting
bind Proposal Draft: ID Donor, Amount Donation, Status Proposal
bind Proposal Review: ID Donor, Status Proposal
bind Proposal Approve: ID Donor, Status Proposal
bind Proposal Submit: ID Donor, Status Proposal
bind Feedback Receive: ID Donor, Type Feedback
bind Terms Negotiate: ID Donor, Type Feedback
bind Agreement Finalize: ID Donor, Status Agreement
ID Donor: integer between 1 and 1000
Amount Donation: float between 1000.0 and 1000000.0
Method Contact: Email, Phone, In-Person
Status Proposal: Drafted, Reviewed, Approved, Submitted
Duration Meeting: integer between 15 and 180
Type Feedback: Positive, Negative, Neutral
Status Agreement: Pending, Finalized
Init[Donor Identify] | |
End[Agreement Finalize] | |
Existence[Proposal Review] | |
Precedence[Proposal Submit, Proposal Approve] | |A.ID Donor == T.ID Donor |
Response[Feedback Receive, Terms Negotiate] | |A.ID Donor == T.ID Donor |0,2,d
Chain Response[Meeting Conduct, Proposal Draft] | |A.ID Donor == T.ID Donor |0,48,h
Responded Existence[Proposal Submit, Feedback Receive] | |A.ID Donor == T.ID Donor |
Precedence[Proposal Review, Proposal Draft] | |A.ID Donor == T.ID Donor |
Co-Existence[Contact Initiate, Meeting Conduct] |A.Method Contact is Phone |A.Method Contact == T.Method Contact |
Not Chain Succession[Feedback Receive, Agreement Finalize] |A.Type Feedback is Negative |A.ID Donor == T.ID Donor |